extraDistr-fortran
==================

This package is a modern Fortran translation of the computational routines in
extraDistr 1.10.0.5.

Upstream authors and contributors:
- Tymoteusz Wolodzko
- Sigbert Klinke
- Thomas Farrar
- Piero Giovanni Luca Porta-Mana

Upstream project: extraDistr, "Additional Univariate and Multivariate
Distributions". The original source declares GPL-2. The translated source is
distributed under GPL-2.0-only and retains the complete upstream source and
original archive under upstream/ for provenance.

This translation is not an official release of the upstream project.
